"""RULE TABLE for prompt-preflight, as data. Single source for the checker output and RULE-TABLE.md.

Every row has an evidence line. `quotes` holds (file, exact text) pairs that the unit tests look up
in the named file, so an evidence line cannot drift from the file it came from.
Paths are relative to the WKP repo root (found from this file's location, never hardcoded).
A row whose evidence is a single case or none says so in `evidence_status`.

Lint ids (R1..R13) are the ids printed by data/firefly-prompt-guide/prompt_lint.py. They are NOT the
same numbers as the rules in STANDARD.md past R4 (see `standard_ref`). PF ids are the new rules.
"""
import os

ROOT = os.environ.get("PREFLIGHT_WKP_ROOT") or os.path.abspath(
    os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)), "..", ".."))

